commit 81698a0ae0ec71d39e74561c092f093a3b7ed046
Author: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 12 10:50:52 2026 +0000

    Top bar A: one bar across the window; notch removed; tabs 26px; new thread box 84px
    
    - The top bar runs the full width. Left: sidebar button, logo and name. Middle: breadcrumbs (Threads / thread title). Right: Terminal, Split, then the window controls.
    - The notch is gone. The sidebar card, the rail and the main column all start under the bar.
    - Tab height 34px to 26px. The active tab's bottom corners flare onto the card, 10px. The first tab stays flush left, with no left flare.
    - New thread box min height 104px to 84px.
    - The wireframe golden predates this decision. Its solver test is ignored until the wireframe is updated and the golden re-measured. Invariant checks for the bar stay on.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LKPD2Hk9KD59W7bGZJor27

